<view wx:if="{{item}}" class="detail-page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="mini-top"><view class="mini-nav"><button class="mini-nav__button" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回上一页"><view class="mini-nav__back"></view></button><view class="mini-nav__divider"></view><button class="mini-nav__button" bindtap="home" aria-label="返回首页"><view class="mini-nav__home"></view></button></view><view class="mini-top__title">积分兑换</view><view class="capsule">•••　│　◎</view></view><view class="content"><view class="product-card"><image src="{{item.cover_url||'/assets/ux/detail-product.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="cost">兑换积分：<text class="strong">{{item.points_cost}}积分</text></view><text>可用库存 {{item.stock}}</text></view></view><view class="notice"><view class="notice-title">温馨提示</view><text>兑换成功后请于7个自然日内到鄞领π服务点领取，逾期订单自动取消并退回未过期积分。</text></view><view class="description"><view class="section-title">商品说明</view><rich-text class="rich-content" nodes="{{item.description||'鄞领π定制好礼，数量有限，兑完即止。'}}"></rich-text></view><view class="address" bindtap="navigate"><view><text class="strong">商品领取地址</text><text>宁波市鄞州区学府路1号</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="action"><view><text class="strong">-{{item.points_cost}} <text class="small">积分</text></text><text>兑换后扣除</text></view><button bindtap="redeem" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{item.stock<=0}}">{{item.stock>0?'我要兑换':'已兑完'}}</button></view></view>
